      <activity id="453df2d5-f019-59fd-934d-26ef41c9f18c" activityNameId="0f74acd4-74af-5cd8-b17f-b62a14562c8e" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Three layered laminated board, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Three layered laminated board, at plant
The multi-output process "three layered laminated board, production" delivers the two coproducts "three layered laminated board, at plant" and "industrial residue wood, 3-layered LB production, softwood, u=20%, at plant". Allocation is based on the over-all proceeds of the process. Inventory adjusted to Swiss production by changing wood and electricity inputs, Philippe Stolz, September 2016.;
UUID: 7b6a2394-00b9-3ee3-b347-9e62991cbc2f
Includes the inputs to the production processes and transports of those inputs. No process emission data are available.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Medium enterprised technology (1995)
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: The assumption that the technology is representative for central Europe is considered in the uncertainties.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7b6a2394-00b9-3ee3-b347-9e62991cbc2f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
